7692232\" /></span><br><br>Explore the massive and sprawling world of Anterra. Find hidden locations, dynamic scenarios and new mysteries to solve as you forge your own unique journey.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">   <li>Spot areas of interest from the overworld.<br>   </li><li>Find loot stashes and special items with hand-drawn treasure maps.<br>   </li><li>Fill out your bestiary to gain combat perks against different enemies.<br>   </li><li>Hunt for the hidden faeries and learn their wisdom.<br>   </li><li>Uncover and solve mysteries using your own perception and intuition.<br>   </li><li>Sail the seas to remote islands.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/b45ac0d087676f0c84ba23feb981262b.poster.avif?t=1717692232\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/b45ac0d087676f0c84ba23feb981262b.webm?t=1717692232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/b45ac0d087676f0c84ba23feb981262b.mp4?t=1717692232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/58efe065a53b7abb0c1bab6a0312e1cb.avif?t=1717692232\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/8328b68dacf9b1b2174c9c4c4eb61fa0.poster.avif?t=1717692232\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/8328b68dacf9b1b2174c9c4c4eb61fa0.webm?t=1717692232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402470/extras/8328b68dacf9b1b2174c9c4c4eb61fa0.mp4?t=171769